pbr-optimal-tip = Move the bore so the highest point of the trajectory touches the top of the vital zone, then report the ranges where the bullet stays inside the zone.
pbr-fixed = Fixed zero
pbr-fixed-tip = Keep the zero range you type. Report the point-blank limits and the maximum ordinate that zero actually produces.
